        <tei:p>Holy art Thou and awe-inspiring is Thy Name and there is no God beside Thee, as it is written, <tei:milestone unit="chapter" n="5"/><tei:milestone unit="verse" n="16" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:isaiah/5/16"/><tei:seg source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:isaiah/5/16" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-sheni-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-two-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n16_medium.jpg">exalted is the Lord of Hosts through judgment and the Holy God is sanctified through righteousness.</tei:seg><tei:milestone unit="verse"/><tei:milestone unit="chapter"/> Blessed art Thou, O Lord, the Holy King.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
